# Sign-In Page Rules

## Purpose
Keep sign-in page minimal and focused

## Strict Guidelines
- **NO additions** to `/src/app/auth/signin/page.tsx`
- Keep only: title, email field, password field, sign-in button, sign-up link
- **NO extra features, links, or components**
- Maintain current clean design
- Only allow bug fixes or security updates

## Current Approved Elements
- App title with book emoji
- Email input
- Password input  
- Sign In button
- "Don't have an account? Sign up" link
- Error message display
- Loading state

## Forbidden
- Additional form fields
- Social login buttons
- Forgot password links
- Extra navigation
- Marketing content
- Feature additions